{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13212090","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13212090","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1321209001:1":{"text":"あのう、すみません。雪だるまが走り去るのを見ませんでしたか？","source_cn":"您好！请问您看到有个小雪人跑过去吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB252F7BAD08D4DC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1321209002:1":{"text":"走り去る？この目の前の雪だるまのことを言ってるの？\n――僕が作ったんだ！この数を作るのはすごく大変だったよ！","source_cn":"什么会跑的雪人？你问前面这堆？\\n——我堆的！费了我好...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x645B0E2E0E5EFC42","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1321209003:1":{"text":"でも、こんなにたくさんの雪だるまをどうするんですか？","source_cn":"你在这里堆这么多雪人做什么呀？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x311C027F9E85429F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321209004:1":{"text":"ああ、これが今回の画題なんだ。","source_cn":"喏，这不是画画的布景嘛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2DD9E135E0106D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321209005:1":{"text":"僕のアイドルであるアトカ画伯も、ちょうどスノーシダー町にスケッチに来てるらしくてね。","source_cn":"我的偶像——大师阿托卡——刚好来雪松镇写生。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC28921A0B97E6B77","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321209006:1":{"text":"画伯？","source_cn":"写生？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C0EDCC3F788730C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321209007:1":{"text":"知らないの？スノーシダー町は花畑が有名で、画伯はそのために来てるんだ。","source_cn":"你们不知道？雪松镇有片花海，很出名的，大师就是为此慕名而来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x61DD6023055A4FAE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1321209008:1":{"text":"そして僕の最高の絵を、画伯に見てもらおうと思ってね。","source_cn":"我呢，想好好画一张满意的作品，然后带去和偶像交流。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA499E16E4CB083D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1321209009:1":{"text":"もしかしたら……アドバイスをもらえたりなんかして！","source_cn":"说不定……还能得到大师的指导呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC90BD4D46D3DD23E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1321209010:1":{"text":"ん？まだ何か用か？早く再開したいんだけど。","source_cn":"嗯？你们怎么还在这里？我要开始画画了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A7A3F787727037C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1321209011:1":{"text":"あの雪だるま、絶対ここに隠れていますよ。","source_cn":"主人，我觉得那个小雪人，绝对藏在这里面。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5496EE6064B4F8D5","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"あの雪だるま、絶対ここに隠れていますよ。","female":"あの雪だるま、絶対ここに隠れていますよ。","variant_male_record_index":"145160","variant_female_record_index":"145161","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1321209012:1":{"text":"ちょっと！画家さんが迷惑そうにしてるのが分からないの？","source_cn":"哎呀！你没听出来这画家在送客吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4694B3E4683F6422","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1321209012":{"text":"ちょっと！画家さんが迷惑そうにしてるのが分からないの？","source_cn":"哎呀！你没听出来这画家在送客吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4694B3E4683F6422","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1321209013:1":{"text":"うん……そうかもしれない……","source_cn":"啊……更多些，会更好看吗……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF65D438AA286E184","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1321209014:1":{"text":"でも、雪だるまを作るには時間もかかるしね……","source_cn":"可是……堆雪人很花费时间啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3A9DEF0A3363403","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1321209017:1":{"text":"あのぅ……なんか急に雪だるまが作りたくなってきたなぁ……","source_cn":"哎呀……突然有点想堆雪人了呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF88D17CDCA9E64C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1321209018:1":{"text":"この大変なときに雪だるま作りなんて……痛っ！なんで脚を踏むんだよ！","source_cn":"这个时候了怎么突然想堆雪人……你踩我干嘛！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06FE54199BEB88BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1321209019:1":{"text":"あっ……そ、そうでした！雪だるまを作りたいんでした！","source_cn":"哦……哦！对！好想堆雪人啊~","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD54113B00D951090","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1321209020:1":{"text":"そうなの？じゃあ……雪だるま作りは任せてもいいかな？","source_cn":"那个，你们要不……帮我堆点雪人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27A1858A02B0F58C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1321209021:1":{"text":"それなら僕はスケッチに集中できるし……早く完成するかもしれない！","source_cn":"我这样就可以专心画画了……也许能快点完成！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9372F6DAD876401D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1321209022:1":{"text":"さすがはマスター！これが狙いだったのですね。","source_cn":"不愧是主人！这样就可以趁机检查雪人了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x53A0D644846084CE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"さすがはマスター！これが狙いだったのですね。","female":"さすがはマスター！これが狙いだったのですね。","variant_male_record_index":"145172","variant_female_record_index":"145173","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:13:0:1":{"text":"もう少し雪だるまがあれば、もっと良さそうだ。","source_cn":"雪人再多点就更好看了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7E2804CB8F6530EA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"もう少し雪だるまがあれば、もっと良さそうだ。","female":"もう少し雪だるまがあれば、もっと良さそうね。","variant_male_record_index":"68616","variant_female_record_index":"68617","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1321209015:1":{"text":"また？まだ描き始めたばかりなのに！","source_cn":"又化了？我还没画几天呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6649BB571B858C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1321209016:1":{"text":"もう雪だるま作りはうんざりだよ！","source_cn":"堆雪人太浪费时间了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04D950110BE6642A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:13:1:2":{"text":"おい！雪だるまが解けだしてるぞ。","source_cn":"哎呀~怎么有些雪人要化了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA3B77E675355A94D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"おい！雪だるまが解けだしてるぞ。","female":"ちょっと！雪だるまが解けだしてるわよ。","variant_male_record_index":"68618","variant_female_record_index":"68619","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロンロン","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:画家派特":{"text":"画家のパルト","source":"画家派特","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"s